    "created_at": "2016-01-13T09:31:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-13T09:31:55Z",
    "body": "I like think it's a great idea. We were also considering adding webconsole logging to identify the reasons for load failures, but this is much better. \n\nI'd also like to see load() return a promise. It would be good if seeking could too, but obviously we'd need to add an explicit seek(time) method rather than seeking via setting currentTime.\n",
